# OpenAI / ChatGPT incremental Surge external ruleset
# Policy is assigned by the importing RULE-SET line.
#
# Use this as a supplement to the existing Blackmatrix7 OpenAI ruleset, not as
# a replacement.  It contains only entries absent from the legacy source:
# https://raw.githubusercontent.com/blackmatrix7/ios_rule_script/master/rule/Surge/OpenAI/OpenAI.list
#
# Verified/collected: 2026-10-09
# - chatgpt.site: https://hello-web-demo-sep30.winx402.chatgpt.site returned
#   the OpenAI / ChatGPT sign-in page (HTTP 401), with a cookie scoped to
#   .chatgpt.site.
# - crixet.com: currently redirects to https://openai.com/prism/.
# - The other entries below are collected only when absent from the legacy
#   list and present in GitHub proxy rulesets:
#   VPSDance/ai-proxy-rules (chat.com, crixet.com, sora.com,
#   openaiassets.blob.core.windows.net, chatgpt.site, oaistatsig.com, and
#   openai.com.cdn.cloudflare.net);
#   flyinjune/surge-rule-set and Bwy999/Surge (openai.fm).
#
# These rules are intentionally limited to OpenAI/ChatGPT-specific domains and
# do not duplicate the legacy list's broad supporting-service rules.

DOMAIN-SUFFIX,chat.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,chatgpt.site
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,crixet.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,oaistatsig.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,openai.com.cdn.cloudflare.net
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,openai.fm
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,sora.com
DOMAIN,openaiassets.blob.core.windows.net
